WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.350 --> 00:00:05.452
Welcome to Computer Class. Today you will learn: Use a USB Drive.

2
00:00:05.752 --> 00:00:11.377
Save files to a USB drive and remove it safely. Follow each step on your own computer.

3
00:00:12.383 --> 00:00:18.812
Step one. Plug the USB drive into the port gently. Wait a moment until the computer finds it.

4
00:00:19.817 --> 00:00:26.895
Step two. Open This PC and click the USB drive. It usually has a letter such as E.

5
00:00:27.883 --> 00:00:32.451
Step three. Copy your files and paste them into the USB drive.

6
00:00:33.450 --> 00:00:41.747
Step four. Before you remove the drive, click the USB icon in the taskbar and choose Eject. Wait for the message, then pull it out.

7
00:00:42.750 --> 00:00:46.784
Now it is your turn. Try these tasks on your own computer.

8
00:00:47.084 --> 00:00:49.316
Copy one file to a USB drive.

9
00:00:49.616 --> 00:00:52.335
Open the file from the USB drive.

10
00:00:52.635 --> 00:00:54.426
Eject the drive the safe way.

11
00:00:54.726 --> 00:00:55.750
Well done!

